This looks like an arugula salad on a square plate, probably about 24 cm across. The greens cover roughly 10 by 15 cm in a loose, light pile. There are a few small brownish bits, possibly nuts or bacon, and a light dressing.

Loose arugula weighs about 30-40 g. I'd add a few grams for the nuts and some dressing, which brings the total to roughly 50 g. The energy is about 25 kcal from the greens, plus roughly 60 kcal from dressing and nuts, so about 85 kcal.

